{"id":283213740,"title":"9.day9-错误-异常-导包","summary":"第一章.多态1.基本使用其实在python中的多态不强调是否真的继承了,在不同的类中只要有相同的方法,就可以完成python中多态的写法2.多态的弊端_扩展弊端:如果子类中有特有方法,调用的时候可能会出现一些问题","content":"<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788874484351-ad23f962-084e-429a-8264-1dea5481e7f5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第一章.多态</h1>\n<h2>1.基本使用</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788874516153-176702c5-adbc-4d70-95fe-ba67fe6caaee.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>其实在python中的多态不强调是否真的继承了,在不同的类中只要有相同的方法,就可以完成python中多态的写法</p>\n<h2>2.多态的弊端_扩展</h2>\n<p>弊端:如果子类中有特有方法,调用的时候可能会出现一些问题</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788874551261-e7a3f514-d86d-4e3b-9652-f2b027159071.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>3.判断对象类型_扩展</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788875307809-0987c638-f7b4-45ef-974f-f2f0861d39c1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788875375106-ac9dfdf5-5eab-4699-883f-f0dcd7d18a41.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788875364627-7b2e6981-55be-49fc-81c0-5ffebc8c9fed.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>4.鸭子类型_扩展</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788875389555-89bed80c-8aa7-4955-aad4-c294cd01372d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第二章.异常的介绍</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788875419472-bd5de5bd-9b82-420d-a851-23f6fcfe2ff4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>1.语法错误</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788875429456-41658e1f-679f-46c7-8219-36edae9a6a1e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>2.异常</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788875450888-46b343e9-6eb4-4fdd-b110-67614100a3d7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788875460657-1b1bd1a5-86be-4787-83b8-a93cca68cd50.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>异常需要处理</p>\n<h1>第三章.异常处理</h1>\n<h2>1.try...except</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788876176169-eafdac13-706e-4d99-92fc-2e66dd89eef7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788876194462-ae13bd6c-05ba-4acf-9b92-ea5d253b44fc.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788876681736-59805f89-4d47-4b83-b25f-a797c2d45094.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788876606176-9bb62eae-1502-431f-a018-045f0c681c11.png?x-oss-process=image%2Fformat%2Cwebp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>2.处理不同类型的异常</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788876228215-fa3cc63c-65fa-4981-8709-7d53f74549ce.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1788876236393-ec8f3511-9072-4e10-94f1-b71689413bf3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>3.else关键字_了解中的了解</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789044961416-ab030abf-ec82-4d8d-b54f-82bffcfd33cf.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789044967829-ea6df5fa-6e7c-4623-8389-b0d9cf47c58d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>4.finally关键字</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789044992141-51ce82bb-dbbf-434e-8471-39a5574fce65.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789045585819-a7516aa0-80d3-410c-8831-c09a9c0aabcb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>5.raise抛出异常</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789045001543-93494842-7288-41dd-8409-c5b34c283b32.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>6.assert断言_了解</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789045015458-c4b5b8aa-3eb3-4496-8f1b-c39e80c5ecd3.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046215850-7eed4be8-7ea0-4920-8132-05c79566188a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第四章.自定义异常</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789045034003-195b05ab-f29b-4186-9c1f-0acd187db320.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第五章.异常的传递</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046410871-e300b293-2a74-4619-92f0-9d586dc9c1e6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第六章.with关键字</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046420009-c880ee5c-94bd-4f53-bf3f-09d0b268e363.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046428599-9a4e1b2a-df1d-42b5-86cf-f115ef6d0db7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第七章.常见的异常</h1>\n<h2>1.异常父类</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046460851-d90d77ad-aced-4ec1-921c-1ff43f4238a9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>2.常见子类异常</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046467738-0dd2801f-2c47-4f03-a6fc-bd29ebfa0987.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第八章.模块</h1>\n<h2>1.模块介绍<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046509087-78cd7fdb-24c2-438c-b24b-4bc5f4188278.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2>2.创建模块</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046515034-d8bd2c68-7b08-4483-b740-4fe979b6d548.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>3.模块的导入</h2>\n<h3>3.1.全局导入</h3>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046538510-43a70b8e-b210-4388-b0fb-c9d7d49ffad2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>3.2.局部导入</h3>\n<h4>3.2.1.情况1<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046569696-24abf145-2341-4c0c-8111-89523bdb5962.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046596857-1db507e9-84fa-4271-89bb-d40b54e30e39.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h4>3.2.2.情况2</h4>\n<h4><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046613801-59761af1-8438-49ff-aa88-fede6bee7b9c.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<h3>3.3. _<em>all</em></h3>\n<p>只能用all里面的【】方法</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046634725-e9b262c4-22ad-4ad0-a44a-4e04e2a2331a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>3.4._<em>name</em></h3>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046645800-76826421-b849-48a6-ba36-c41fff836e7f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046662331-c36dbfc0-3a49-49c0-964b-b76bb3395c37.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>此时此刻，__name__的值为my_add了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789048880733-840657a1-24f1-4805-bb68-925b7d1e91b3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789048996941-ba6900f6-9414-4b3c-b934-a282578f9b16.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第九章.包</h1>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789046681030-b9829306-cd22-4b43-a767-b7008481acaa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/17890466